graph TD
    A[Continue] --> B[Enter Coordinator::run infinite loop]
    B --> C{User command queue empty}
    C -->|No| D[Update specified channel's inner-state based on command]
    D --> B
    C -->|Yes| E[int j = 0]

    subgraph ForEachChannel["For each channel j"]
        E --> F{j < number of channels}
        F -->|True| G{jth channel mode}
        G -->|Standby| INC[j = j++]
        G -->|Steady| H[Run steady mode operation on jth channel]
        G -->|Sweep| I[Run sweep mode operation on jth channel]
        H --> INC
        I --> INC
        INC --> F
    end

    F -->|False| B
